{"id": "tea:daksinamurti-upanisad:1", "source": "src:daksinamurti-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1"}, "paraphrase": "Sages led by Śaunaka at Brahmāvarta, under a great banyan, ask Mārkaṇḍeya how he lives long in bliss; he: by the secret knowledge of Śiva (Śiva-tattva).", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["general"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["teacher-transmission"], "teachers": ["tch:markandeya", "tch:saunaka-mahasala"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:daksinamurti-upanisad:2-3", "source": "src:daksinamurti-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "2-3"}, "paraphrase": "The deity is Dakṣiṇāmūrti; his mantras are given with meditation forms — the teacher seated under the banyan, showing the gesture of knowledge in silence.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "devotional", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion", "sound"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["sound-language", "teacher-transmission"], "practices": ["prc:siva-mantra-japa"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:daksinamurti-upanisad:4-6", "source": "src:daksinamurti-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "4-6"}, "paraphrase": "The lamp of knowledge burns with the oil of dispassion and the wick of devotion; 'dakṣiṇā' means understanding (śemuṣī), and he who faces it is Dakṣiṇāmūrti; by this knowledge Brahmā gained power to create.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "intermediate"}, "types": ["ultimate", "practice"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
